@startuml
scale 1.5
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontSize 14



[*] --> CREATED : System Event Triggered\n(create_notification)

CREATED -right-> PERSISTED : Database Insert\n(is_read = false)

PERSISTED -right-> PUBLISHED : Published to Redis Pub/Sub\n(notifications_channel)

PUBLISHED --> UNREAD_DELIVERED : Real-Time WSS Push to UI\n(Badge Counter + Toast Alert)

UNREAD_DELIVERED -left-> READ : User Clicks Notification / Mark as Read / Mark All as Read\n(UPDATE is_read = true)

READ --> ARCHIVED : Auto-Archived in History\n(50 Most Recent Retained)

ARCHIVED --> [*]
@enduml
